Tell the progress of appending imported headers

Appending a headers import to the target stores takes most of an import:
on a phone, about 17 minutes of 20 for Mutinynet's 3.6 million headers,
with nothing told until it ends. ImportOptions.Progress, if set, is now
told the height up to which headers are appended, of the height to
reach, as each region starts and after each batch: rising from one
region to the next, an import resumed into stores at different heights
included. So is HeadersImportConfig.Progress. Nothing else changes.

Applies to github.com/lightninglabs/neutrino v0.18.0.

